SUMMARY: CITY COUNCIL
DESCRIPTION:Attend the Meeting: Members of the public can attend City Cou
 ncil meetings in person at the Council Chamber\, Toronto City Hall\, or w
 atch live via the City of Toronto's YouTube Channel at youtube.com/Toront
 oCityCouncilLive http://youtube.com/TorontoCityCouncilLive\n\nSubmit Writ
 ten Comments: Email clerk@toronto.ca mailto:clerk@toronto.ca . Clearly re
 ference the agenda item number and title in your submission. Note: public
  deputations are heard at Committees\, not directly at City Council\, unl
 ess required by law.\n\nView Agendas & Minutes: toronto.ca/council http:/
 /toronto.ca/council\n\nParticipation Guidelines: toronto.ca/city-governme
 nt/council/council-committee-meetings/have-your-say/ http://toronto.ca/ci
 ty-government/council/council-committee-meetings/have-your-say/\n\nGenera
 l Inquiries: 311 | (416) 392-2489 | 311@toronto.ca mailto:311@toronto.ca\
 n\nAccessibility Accommodations: accessibility@toronto.ca mailto:accessib
 ility@toronto.ca | (416) 392-5431\n\nStay informed on Ward 23 news: subsc
 ribe to Councillor Myers' newsletter at jamaalmyers.com http://jamaalmyer
 s.com/
